---

<section id="about" class="relative bg-surface text-ink">
  <span class="corner corner-tl border-ink/20" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="corner corner-br border-ink/20" aria-hidden="true"></span>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-28 md:py-40">
    <p class="readout text-ink/45" data-reveal>01 — Who we are</p>
    <h2
      class="sweep mt-6 max-w-3xl font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.05] text-ink md:text-6xl"
      data-sweep
    >
      Precision, by design.
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70" data-reveal>
        Integrant designs and delivers orthopaedic implant systems and
        biologics for surgeons across Australia and New Zealand — from
        fixation platforms to regenerative scaffolds, engineered to the
        standard the theatre demands.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70" data-reveal>
        Behind every system is a single conviction: that surgical hardware,
        biologics and the technology around them should be built with the
        same precision surgeons bring to the table.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
